{"body":{"model":"fable","reads":{"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000000"},"seedFrom":"outside","top":{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EB"},"understandings":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ED"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ET"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ER"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ES"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F8"}]},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EA","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000J"],"name":"branch-16"}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a tie is allowed to last","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F3"}],"prose":"The whole the paper draws is an order whose parts persist while the ties between them do not: meanings, goals, workflows and federations are made at the moment they are needed and released once the need has passed. Every section returns to this one move, replacing a structure that must exist beforehand with one that arises and recedes.","title":"Binding made for the occasion"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EB","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where authority stops","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ED"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EG"}],"prose":"A pyramid is drawn with the greatest authority at its top, and in the same breath that authority is reduced to the right to synchronise and restructure, never to command an interior. The highest holon in the paper is also the one most insistently said not to replace anyone.","title":"Authority that does not own"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EC","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"degree of autonomy","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000S5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000XY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000117"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"The holarchy is introduced as a pyramid in which lower levels execute directives from above, and is immediately re-described as a distribution of responsibility that preserves local autonomy. Later the holons are allowed to be not fully autonomous at all, their degree of freedom set by position and objective.","title":"The pyramid and its softening"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ED","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"coordination without control","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007T8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100096G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A18"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon oversees, binds, arbitrates, aligns goals and restructures workflows, and holds what the case study calls the highest authority. It is at the same time declared a supra-holonic mechanism that enforces no uniform behaviour and never reaches into another holon's logic.","title":"The coordinator above the holons"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EE","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far the coordinator may reach into connectivity","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100085J"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008BN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008GG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008HG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008JG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"}],"prose":"New elements are entered as nodes in a capability graph, found there on request, linked into a workflow blueprint and executed. The last two links may be removed, leaving a coordinator that controls execution but cannot change who is connected to whom.","title":"The component chain and its detachable tail"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EF","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the scale at which authority is read","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Inside the coordinator its orchestrator is a superholon to the coordinator's own parts; inside the simulation a federate twin of the coordinator holds authority limited to the simulation while remaining its subholon. The same shape of authority repeats at each scale, and the simulated holon is both the actor and the thing acted on.","title":"Authority mirrored at smaller scales"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EG","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"design time against runtime","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"}],"prose":"Shared standards, common meta-models and comprehensive ontologies are set aside in favour of agreements struck between two holons at the moment they meet. What is fixed is moved from design time to the encounter itself.","title":"Meaning settled at runtime"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EH","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much must be shared beforehand","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005V8"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005YH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005ZX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100061Y"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100062D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000633"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006YB"}],"prose":"Interoperation can be had by everyone adopting one format, by everyone mapping to one shared layer, or by translating between pairs with nothing shared at all. The third is kept because the first two impose a global constraint that forbids a part from evolving on its own.","title":"Three ways to interoperate, one kept"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime of a shared meaning","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008ZN"}],"prose":"A shared vocabulary is made for a task phase, an episode or a single exchange, used, and then discarded or updated, with versioning letting several states coexist. Semantic coherence is kept without a repository that must be maintained for all time.","title":"Short-lived ontologies as temporary contracts"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EK","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which capacity of the model is drawn on","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008DY"}],"prose":"Among the abstract components, two are given a concrete body: a large language model fills the orchestrator for its reasoning and the translator for its adaptability to new inputs. The same kind of model is drawn on twice for different capacities.","title":"The one technology given a name"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EM","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what a name is attached to","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ET"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EX"}],"prose":"Five named capabilities are first qualities a decision ought to have, then become components inside the coordinator, then become travellers, buses and roads in a mobility scene. The name survives each descent; what it is attached to does not.","title":"Names that change body with scale"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EN","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which failure each capability answers","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ER"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000ES"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001SM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003MJ"}],"prose":"A list of what current autonomous systems lack is answered by a list of holon types, each type named for the lack it addresses. The pairing is nearly one to one, with efficiency-only thinking added as a lack of its own.","title":"Failures answered one by one"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EP","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what counts as wrong","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003RT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003VP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100041S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004RR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004V7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100050V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100051N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"}],"prose":"Ethical and unbiased holons are both built on an ontology of what is wrong, one of harms and rules, the other of known bias patterns, and both pass their verdicts forward to whoever balances. Defining the wrong is named as the hardest part of each.","title":"The checking pair"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EQ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"length of the horizon","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"An efficient holon reaches its goal with least resource; an effective one lengthens the horizon to take in consequence, society and sustainability, and is harder to measure for exactly that reason.","title":"Effective against efficient"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ER","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"whether knowing is local or shared","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100053C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100055S"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005B9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"}],"prose":"Understanding holons build situational knowledge from heterogeneous data inside themselves; vigilant holons distribute awareness across levels so that locally informed parts stay globally aligned. One is the interior of knowing, the other its circulation.","title":"Knowing within and knowing across"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ES","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what function a capability performs for the coordinator","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000720"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100078M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007BE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007DN"}],"prose":"Inside the coordinator the unbiased holon becomes a dictionary that keeps retrieval accurate, the ethical holon a validation layer or a guard against leaks, the vigilant holon the orchestrator itself, and the effective and efficient ones subsystems that need a cue to know when to act.","title":"The five re-cast as components"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000ET","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"who in the scene carries which capability","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009P6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009ZZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A1Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"In the mobility case the capabilities become people and things: travellers are understanding holons, transport services are unbiased and effective ones, roads and weather are vigilant, the channel to outside organisations is unbiased, and ethical and unbiased holons set policy before anything moves.","title":"The five as actors in a scene"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EV","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where there is nothing to coordinate","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100099R"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009BC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009GP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009KE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AX3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B2C"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B4Q"}],"prose":"Rural mobility is the single setting worked through: dispersed and unpredictable demand, services too costly to run on a timetable, and a second aim beside routing, which is to find the places where there is no transport at all to coordinate.","title":"The one scene held still"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EW","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"direction of flow between capabilities","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"The checks feed the balancer, the interpreter feeds both, and the watcher spans every layer; in the emergency scenes each domain is handed to one capability. The relations are drawn as flows between named roles rather than as a hierarchy.","title":"The five among themselves"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EX","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what happens when something breaks","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EZ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EW"}],"prose":"Nearly every illustration opens with something breaking: an incident, an earthquake, a pandemic, a geopolitical shock, a route that fails validation. The system is defined less by what it does when things go well than by what it rearranges without stopping when they do not.","title":"A system known by its interruptions"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EY","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"continuity through change","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005NH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100067V"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007XX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000A6A"}],"prose":"Holons may be added, removed or modified, workflows regenerated and roles reassigned while the system keeps running; a disruption is met by reconfiguration rather than by reprogramming. How far the coordinator may reach into connectivity is itself left adjustable.","title":"Rearranging without restarting"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000EZ","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what a discrepancy does","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10009MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AAN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ABH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000AQ7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000ASK"}],"prose":"The simulation replaces the users' calls and tests the platform's answers, with each holon replicated as a federate joined to its live counterpart. A discrepancy anywhere is flagged upward, invalidates the result and may send the whole federation back to its beginning.","title":"The simulation as rehearsal"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F0","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how much the actor steers its own stage","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003BH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003CN"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003DJ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003EC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003FX"}],"prose":"Holons in a simulation may only report, may respond, may learn from past runs, or may rewrite the rules and objectives of the run itself. The ladder measures how much the simulated thing is allowed to steer its own stage.","title":"Four grades of steering"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F1","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"which scene is used to show a capability","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004YA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004ZM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"Smart cities, healthcare, supply chains, disaster response and autonomous vehicles return in every section as the backdrop against which a capability is shown. The entrance is almost always an emergency.","title":"The same few stages"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F2","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what is inherited and what is new","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G20000F8"}],"prose":"The paper's novelties are produced by putting one word where another stood, by extending a lineage one step, and by drawing a careful line around what is not being claimed. Reading it means seeing which of its parts are inherited, which are moved, and where the moving shows.","title":"New things made by substitution"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F3","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"how far back the idea reaches","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000080"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000A4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100015P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001DR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001N2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10001QH"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100064G"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006JR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006MS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006N7"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006P5"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006PX"}],"prose":"The idea runs from Koestler's nested wholes through manufacturing systems of the 1990s to grids, construction sites and cyber-physical plants, and the authors' own earlier work on understanding and on federated interoperability is folded in as the most recent step.","title":"A lineage carried forward"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F4","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what the substitution adds","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002H1"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100038Z"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BAT"}],"prose":"Agent-directed simulation has three kinds; because holons are taken to be a special class of agent, holon-directed simulation is given the same three by inference, and the term is claimed as used formally for the first time. What the substitution adds is organisational awareness and coordination across levels.","title":"Holon put where agent stood"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F5","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the line between claimed and deferred","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003HV"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003KQ"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006HS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008K2"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008NE"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008PY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008R4"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008WD"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10008Y6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000922"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000B69"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000BDC"}],"prose":"Technical interoperability is assumed rather than contributed, two components of the coordinator may be dropped, the case study is said not to be a validation, and empirical testing is named as absent. Standardisation, scale, security and governance are listed as challenges and left for others.","title":"What is set outside the claim"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F6","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"where the seams lie","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002ST"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003G9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003ZC"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100040N"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100049M"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004AX"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005XG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005Y0"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZT"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100086H"}],"prose":"The examples under effective holons are those under ethical holons word for word; the organisational and technology barriers carry each other's definitions; a sentence in Sect. 3 breaks off and resumes in Sect. 3.2; empty bullets stand in the coordinator's architecture. The text keeps the marks of having been put together from parts.","title":"Where the assembly shows"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F7","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"what the holon draws in from outside","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100022Q"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100025W"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100028F"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002AR"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10002EY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10003JT"}],"prose":"Digital twins supply live data and virtual counterparts, AI supplies prediction and learning, federated learning supplies adaptation without pooling data; these are the motives offered for extending the holon at all, and the integration with them is also listed as still to be explored.","title":"What the holon draws in from outside"},"id":"1M6YBY3G20000F8","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}